\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {12}{\ignorespaces Calibration sweep for the Betti-curve (BC) vectorization, one-at-a-time around the native-budget default (grid\_size $=128$, $q=0.95$), on the \emph  {params} task for both the Thomas and nested-Thomas design distributions (Section~\ref {sec:simulator}). Diagrams use the default $DTM_{\{5,10,15\}}$, $H_0{+}H_1$ pipeline (Euler channel disabled, see text) and shared-weight architecture of Section~\ref {ssec:encoder-fusion}. Padding is fixed at $\alpha =1.05$ throughout -- the value selected for the persistence image -- rather than this vectorization's own code default of $\alpha =1.1$. Cells report $\mathcal  {L}$ (Section~\ref {ssec:exp-performance}, mean $\pm $ sd over 3 seeds).}}{24}{table.12}\protected@file@percent }
